<title>USA: British Aerospace Plc unit issues notes.</title>
<headline>British Aerospace Plc unit issues notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following two-tranche 144A debt issue from British Finance Inc, the financing arm of British Aerospace Plc was priced on Thursday via JP Morgan Securities Inc, according to a syndicate source.</p>
<p>BORROWER BRITISH AEROSPACE FINANCE INC</p>
<p>AMT $200 MLN	 COUPON 7.00 PCT   MATURITY 7/1/2007</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 99.724  FIRST PAY DATE 1/1/1998</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S A3    YIELD 7.039 PCT   PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P A-MINUS   SPREAD +58 BPS    CALLABLE  NO</p>
<p>AMT $500 MLN	 COUPON 7.50 PCT   MATURITY 7/1/2037</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 99.257  FIRST PAY DATE 1/1/1998</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S A3    YIELD 7.563 PCT   PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P A-MINUS   SPREAD +78 BPS    CALLABLE  NO</p>
</text>
